-- WoW Forever: third batch of Forever quests players do on the live realm that our world did not have, with the NPCs and
-- objects they need (first batches: 2026_11_22_80 and _83).
-- Part 1, NPCs and objects: 24 new NPCs (name, level, type, elite, class, model, health) and 6 new objects (type, model, size,
-- lock and loot settings), plus spawns for those and 2 existing NPCs and 14 existing objects that had none.
--   NPC and object records: Data from Efficient Games (https://efficient.games), licensed under CC BY 4.0
--   (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Source: github.com/JIVESCORP/eg-link-output-wowf creature and object caches.
--   Changed: picked and converted to our tables.
--   NPCs EG Link has no record of (Hyjal furbolgs and harpies, Tainted Shrubbery, Barton, Ancient Fire Elemental, Virulent Blood):
--   level, type, model and reaction from the Wowhead Forever NPC pages.
--   Faction: the faction Wowhead names, matched to its faction template in the client's FactionTemplate table (Booty Bay 120,
--   Gadgetzan 474, Darnassus 80, Orgrimmar 29, Undercity 68, Syndicate 87, Elemental 91, Barkskin Burrow 3569); otherwise from
--   the reaction shown (both sides 35, hostile 16, neutral 7). ESTIMATED where no faction is named.
--   Spawn spots: Wowhead map spots turned into world coordinates with per-zone fits (EG Link players' positions), heights read on
--   dev (terrain and every model surface; where several, the one a nearby spawn stands on). Unique NPCs get one spawn, mobs and
--   gatherable objects every spot (mobs wander 5 yd, respawn 300 s; objects 120 s). Orientation ESTIMATED.
--   creature_model_info for 10 new displays: copied from a display with the same model (client CreatureDisplayInfo), ESTIMATED
--   (VerifiedBuild -1); Gharrik's carrion bird model from the common carrion bird display 126647.
--   Object loot: the quest item each one holds (Wowhead Forever), 100%, quest only.
-- Part 2, quests: full live record from EG Link (same credit as above): title, story, objective line, levels, races, flags,
--   objectives with their live ids, rewards, start item, and the giver's progress and reward lines; givers, turn-ins, lines EG
--   Link lacks and quest item drop chances (players' loot counts) from Wowhead Forever. Only quests whose giver, turn-in and every
--   objective target exist and are spawned are here. Previous-quest locks are not set.
-- Guids 47610000-47610999 (creature and gameobject). Safe to run again: every row is replaced by key.

